model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "A provisioning kick dispatches successive batches until no jobs are runnable, retaining dispatch leases and deferred retries. Member setup finishes the current defaults before personal-team creation. After the committed provision and existing webhook wake steps, a native Workflow alarm defers the provisioning continuation for three seconds; it calls Cron's placed handler only while runnable work remains. Plain and encrypted journals retain stable wake identities. Workflow IDs, claims, readiness assertions and deadlines remain unchanged."
    }
  }
}
